ps  close to him and actually values as a  friend however Matt was not Miller's  only acquaintance in this world as even  though Melo possessed a deep hatred  towards his own perceived rival Nia he  did also have great respect for him and  provided him with a lot of useful  information later proving  extraordinarily vital in Kira's downfall  for example he informed NIR about the  concepts of the Shinigami at the death  note and the to fake rules that were  written in one of the death notes and  these facts helped near immensely as he  became certain that Kira was a member of  the Japanese task force and set his  sights on by alchemy as the series went  on though MELAS aggressive methods would  generate several key setbacks such as  having been threatened at gunpoint  having his hideouts found and destroyed  as well as Mela having to self-destruct  one while he was still inside because of  this he acquired a large scar on the  left side of his face towards the end of  the series but even with this misfortune  he never lost his dedication and  willingness to fight for his admittedly  primarily selfish goals and in this  effort Mello would come to kidnap Kira  spokeswoman Kiyomi Takada however whilst  captive taka died was able to kill  Miller by writing his name on a piece of  death note she had with her before  proceeding to get killed herself with  another death note by light  however Miller's actions would prove  vital in taking down Kira as toccatas  kidnapping led to one of Kira's  followers accidentally revealing  information to nia which eventually  culminated in Kira's defeat although it  is debatable whether Mello knew his  actions were necessary in order for cure  to be caught or if he was simply and  purely working towards his own goals the  entire time in the end near noted that  Melo was one of the most integral  elements in closing the Cure case and  that to get  they had surpassed L and following the  death of Light Yagami  Nia officially became the next L and to  Shirin eating chocolate at the end of  the series as a sign of respect towards  Miller small fun facts about Miller  mellows clothing was based entirely on  the kind of fashion that the illustrator  of Death Note Takeshi Obata enjoyed  drawing the most in a shocking potential  turn of events originally Melo was  supposed to be the one who would defeat  white however this plan eventually  changed due to the idea that Mellors  knowledge concerning the Death Note  would have made it far too easy for him  thus making the finale much less intense  while Melo was absent from the Death  Note live-action films elders consumed  several chocolates as a note to the  character melos death was only showing  very briefly in both the anime and the  manga due to concerns if it was  presented in a more drastic manner it  could have potentially spoiled the  meaning and significance of the demise  Mello is interestingly enough the only  one of the three detectives from Riley's  house who investigated the Kira case and  never met Light Yagami in person and  finally a truly useless fact amongst the  Death Note fanbase there are rumors  speculating that Madonna cos played  mellow for her music video jump although  this has never being confirmed thus  making it a piece of exceptionally  useless knowledge and that pretty much  does it for Mello if you enjoyed this  video and the content this channel  produced in general and please do  consider donating to the new world  review patreon because the support of  all the amazing people is what continues  to make this channel possible and if  patreon isn't quite your style then  please do leave this video a like share  or subscribe because it also helps  support this channel an incredible  amount and if you'd like to join the fun  at any time then please do head over to  my discord server where a wide array of  shenanigan retakes place on a daily  basis and finally please do comment with  who what or where you'd like to see  featured